<title>BELGIUM: EU would decide Swedish EMU opt-out - Santer.</title>
<headline>EU would decide Swedish EMU opt-out - Santer.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Commission President Jacques Santer said on Wednesday it would be up to European Union leaders to decide whether Sweden could opt-out of economic and monetary union (EMU) if it qualified.</p>
<p>&quot;It's up to heads of state and government to take this decision,&quot; Santer said when asked at a news conference about whether Sweden has a right to opt out.</p>
</text>
